## 8. True Context Moment System (Phase 3)

### 8.1 Signal Processing

```typescript
interface ContextSignals {
  isNearLocation: boolean;
  minutesFreeOnCalendar: number;
  currentHour: number;
  taskDurationMinutes: number;
  isLaptopMode: boolean;
}

function evaluateTrueContextMoment(signals: ContextSignals): boolean {
  return signals.isNearLocation 
    && signals.minutesFreeOnCalendar >= (signals.taskDurationMinutes + 10)
    && signals.currentHour >= 8 && signals.currentHour <= 20;
}
```

### 8.2 Geofencing Implementation

- Use `expo-location` with `startGeofencingAsync`
- Maximum 10 active geofences at any time
- Default radius: 200m, configurable 100–500m
- Location data processed on-device only

