## 11. Security Requirements

### 11.1 Authentication

- JWT: 1-hour expiry
- Refresh tokens: 30-day expiry, rotated on use
- Rate limiting: 5 failures → 15-minute lockout
- Password min: 8 characters

### 11.2 API Security

- HTTPS enforced
- Input validation via Zod schemas
- SQL injection prevention via Drizzle ORM
- Supabase RLS policies enforced

### 11.3 Data Security

- Task content encrypted at rest (SQLCipher Phase 2)
- Sync payloads encrypted before upload
- Server never stores decrypted individual task content
- Biometric/PIN optional per app open
- Auto-lock after 10 minutes background

