## 13. Error Handling Strategy

### 13.1 Error Categories

**Silent failures (log only):**
- Background sync failures (retry silently)
- Analytics delivery failures
- ML model inference errors (fall back to static)

**Graceful degradation:**
- Calendar unavailable → hide time features
- Location denied → disable geofencing, show explanation
- Server unreachable → full offline mode + badge

**User-facing errors:**
- Auth failure → "Session expired. Sign in again."
- Sync conflict → Show resolver UI
- Team access denied → "No access to workspace."

